--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
External tools
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

PDF engraving is performed by invoking LilyPond (GPL-3.0) as a separate
process. LilyPond is not linked, bundled or redistributed with this software,
and the program functions without it (emitting LilyPond, MusicXML and MIDI
sources instead).

The audio files in synthetic_samples/ are this project's own generated
material, rendered by invoking FluidSynth (LGPL-2.1) as a separate process
with the GeneralUser GS soundbank by S. Christian Collins
(https://github.com/mrbumpy409/GeneralUser-GS), whose licence permits
unrestricted use of rendered audio. Neither FluidSynth nor the soundbank is
linked, bundled or redistributed; tools/music-teacher/fetch-soundfont.sh
downloads the soundbank to a local cache with its checksum and provenance.
